          'similar: new approach, novel method, strategy, framework) for '
          'studying something “with artificial intelligence” (or similar '
          'wording). In the same article, it mentions a paper that was '
          'published sometime between 2016-01-01 and 2021-12-31. Extract: the '
          'article’s author/byline, title, publication date; the exact quote '
          'mentioning the new strategy with AI; and for the mentioned paper: '
          'its title (if present), year, and the full author list as presented '
          '(in order, copying exact spelling and order). Also identify the '
          'last-listed author (copy exact).\n'
          '- Role3 (2001 volume 68 paper): A paper published in 2001 that is '
